22-2511\">Valentina Mignosa\u003C/a>\u003C/p>  \u003Cp>[...] Myskon, son of Damis son of Kobetos [...] Anthemokritos bade Apellis offer security [...] said [...] was; he came upon [...] of the Leontines [...] Myskon sitting along the avenue [...] came (not?) having the money, the price of the cattle; he did not buy [...] went to Empedokles, son of Mnasimachos [...] let [...] become (liable?) to act as surety (trans. by Miller).\u003C/p>  ",{"id":265,"html":268},"\u003Ch2>Italian translation\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"translation-author\">\u003Ca href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7122-2511\">Valentina Mignosa\u003C/a>\u003C/p>  \u003Cp>[...] Myskon, figlio di Damis figlio di Kobetos [...] Anthemokritos ordinò ad Apelis(?) di agire da garante [...] disse [...] era; si imbatté [...] dei Leontini [...] Myskon seduto lungo il viale [...] venne (non?) avendo il denaro, il prezzo del bestiame; non comprò [...] andò da Empedokles, figlio di Mnasimachos [...] lasciò che [...] diventasse garante.\u003C/p>  ",{"id":270,"html":271},"commentary","\u003Ch2>commentary\u003C/h2>  \u003Cp>The text appears on the obverse of an opisthographic lamina with a defixio on the reverse (ISic030019, Arena II(2), no. 45, Curbera no.13).\u003C/p>  ",{"id":273,"html":274},"bibliography","\u003Ch2>bibliography\u003C/h2>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli> Miller 1973 fig. p. 37 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002516\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002516\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Brugnone 1980-1981 437-438 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001462\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001462\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Arena 1989 77 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000638\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000638\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Dubois 1989 \u003Ca href=\"http://www.persee.fr/doc/efr_0000-0000_1989_cat_119_1\" target=\"_blank\">134 face a\u003C/a>  \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000187\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000187\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Arena 1992 80 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000639\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000639\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> 1995 45.1359 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Van Effenterre and Ruzé 1995 228-230 no.63 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001022\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001022\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> Arena 2002 79 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001373\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001373\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> 2004 54.0881 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> 2007 57.0905 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  ",{"id":276,"html":277},"license"," Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. ",[279,281,284,285],{"html":280},"Text encoding: Valentina Mignosa",{"id":282,"lang":104,"html":283},"edition-interpretive","\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  \u003Ca id=\"al1-interpretive\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span> Μ]υσκο̄ν dipunct Δάμιος dipunct τοῦ Κοβέτου \u003Cbr id=\"al2-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span> Ἀνθ]εμόκριτος dipunct ἐφίετο Ἄπελιν ἐνγυάσασθαι \u003Cbr id=\"al3-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>[\u003Csp